@host = http://localhost:8081
@embeddingService = http://127.0.0.1:8001
@limit10 = 10
@limit20 = 20

### Embedding service health
GET {{embeddingService}}/health

### Embedding service model info
GET {{embeddingService}}/model-info

### Embeddings status
GET {{host}}/internal/embeddings/status

### Prepare job embeddings metadata
POST {{host}}/internal/embeddings/backfill/jobs?limit=100

### Prepare profile embeddings metadata
POST {{host}}/internal/embeddings/backfill/profiles?limit=100

### Process pending BGE-M3 embeddings
POST {{host}}/internal/embeddings/process/bge-m3/pending?limit=5

### Backend Senior Java Cloud - Top 10
GET {{host}}/internal/analysis/profiles/2/vector-first-compatibility?limit={{limit10}}

### Backend Senior Java Cloud - Top 20
GET {{host}}/internal/analysis/profiles/2/vector-first-compatibility?limit={{limit20}}

### Backend Strong Partial DevOps Transfer - Top 10
GET {{host}}/internal/analysis/profiles/3/vector-first-compatibility?limit={{limit10}}

### Backend Strong Partial DevOps Transfer - Top 20
GET {{host}}/internal/analysis/profiles/3/vector-first-compatibility?limit={{limit20}}

### IT Support Analyst Junior - Top 10
GET {{host}}/internal/analysis/profiles/4/vector-first-compatibility?limit={{limit10}}

### IT Support Analyst Junior - Top 20
GET {{host}}/internal/analysis/profiles/4/vector-first-compatibility?limit={{limit20}}

### Data BI SQL Profile - Top 10
GET {{host}}/internal/analysis/profiles/5/vector-first-compatibility?limit={{limit10}}

### Data BI SQL Profile - Top 20
GET {{host}}/internal/analysis/profiles/5/vector-first-compatibility?limit={{limit20}}

### Backend Trainee Projects - Top 10
GET {{host}}/internal/analysis/profiles/6/vector-first-compatibility?limit={{limit10}}

### Backend Trainee Projects - Top 20
GET {{host}}/internal/analysis/profiles/6/vector-first-compatibility?limit={{limit20}}

