### Raw vector search - Backend Senior Java Cloud
GET {{host}}/internal/embeddings/vector-search/profiles/2/jobs?limit={{limit20}}&embeddingModel=BAAI/bge-m3

### Raw vector search - Backend Strong Partial DevOps Transfer
GET {{host}}/internal/embeddings/vector-search/profiles/3/jobs?limit={{limit20}}&embeddingModel=BAAI/bge-m3

### Raw vector search - IT Support Analyst Junior
GET {{host}}/internal/embeddings/vector-search/profiles/4/jobs?limit={{limit20}}&embeddingModel=BAAI/bge-m3

### Raw vector search - Data BI SQL Profile
GET {{host}}/internal/embeddings/vector-search/profiles/5/jobs?limit={{limit20}}&embeddingModel=BAAI/bge-m3

### Raw vector search - Backend Trainee Projects
GET {{host}}/internal/embeddings/vector-search/profiles/6/jobs?limit={{limit20}}&embeddingModel=BAAI/bge-m3

